Package: eco230r
Type: Package
Title: Helper Functions for ECO 230 Data Analysis Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mike", "Boland", email = "mboland@uwlax.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Helper functions, datasets, and reporting tools used in the
    University of Wisconsin–La Crosse course ECO 230: Data Analysis.
    The package provides simplified workflows for descriptive statistics,
    tables, hypothesis tests (t-tests, ANOVA, chi-square, etc.), regression,
    and formatted output so students can focus on interpretation rather
    than coding syntax.
